(53, 'Historical Evaluation of Quality', 'historical-evaluation-of-quality', '<p><img src=\"http://zedv2.umon.in/uploads/Historical-Evaluation-Of-Quality.jpg\" alt=\"Historical Evaluation of Quality\"><br></p><h4>Week 1 Details<br></h4><p></p><ul><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/Historical_Evaluation_of_Quality/Basic_Definitions_of_Quality_&amp;_Historical_Development_of_TQM_1/story.html\" title=\"Basic Definitions of Quality &amp; Historical Development of TQM\">Basic Definitions of Quality &amp; Historical Development of TQM</a></li><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/Historical_Evaluation_of_Quality/Introduction_to_TQM_Philosophies_Principles_&amp;_Concepts_2/story.html\" title=\"Introduction to TQM - Philosophies, Principles &amp; Concepts\">Introduction to TQM - Philosophies, Principles &amp; Concepts</a></li><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/Historical_Evaluation_of_Quality/Introduction_to_TQM_Contributions_of_Edward_Deming_&amp;_Philip_Crosby_3/story.html\" title=\"Introduction to TQM - Contributions of Edward Deming &amp; Philip Crosby\">Introduction to TQM - Contributions of Edward Deming &amp; Philip Crosby</a></li><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/Historical_Evaluation_of_Quality/Introduction_to_TQM_Contributions_of_Joseph_M_Juran_4/story.html\" title=\"Introduction to TQM - Contributions of Joseph M Juran\">Introduction to TQM - Contributions of Joseph M Juran</a></li></ul><h4>Week 2 Details</h4><p></p><ul><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/Historical_Evaluation_of_Quality/Quality_Gurus_&amp;_Their_Contributions_Efforts_of_Walter_Shewhart_&amp;_Edward_Deming_5/story.html\" title=\"Quality Gurus &amp; Their Contributions, Efforts of Walter Shewhart &amp; Edward Deming\">Quality Gurus &amp; Their Contributions, Efforts of Walter Shewhart &amp; Edward Deming</a><br></li><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/Historical_Evaluation_of_Quality/Quality_Gurus_&amp;_Their_Contributions_6/story.html\