(56, 'HR Principles and TQM ', 'hr-principles-and-tqm', '<h4><img src=\"http://zedv2.umon.in/uploads/ORGANIZATIONAL_CULTURE2.jpg\" alt=\"HR Principles and TQM\"><span>Week 1\r\ndetails</span></h4><p><span><ul><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/HR_Principles_and_TQM/Organizational_Culture_1/story.html\" title=\"Organizational Culture\">Organizational Culture</a><br></li><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/HR_Principles_and_TQM/Strategic_Planning_and_SWOT_Analysis_2/story.html\" title=\"Strategic Planning and SWOT Analysis\">Strategic Planning and SWOT Analysis</a><br></li><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/HR_Principles_and_TQM/Strategic_Planning_and_Strategic_Programming_3/story.html\" title=\"Strategic Planning and Strategic Programming\">Strategic Planning and Strategic Programming</a><br></li><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/HR_Principles_and_TQM/Vision_Mission_Objectives_Goals_Targets_and_Action_Plans_4/story.html\" title=\"Vision,Mission, Objectives, Goals, Targets and Action Plans\">Vision,Mission, Objectives, Goals, Targets and Action Plans</a><br></li></ul></span><span><br></span><h4><span>Week 2\r\ndetails</span></h4></p><p><span><ul><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/HR_Principles_and_TQM/Team_Dynamics_and_Conflict_Management_5/story.html\" title=\"Team Dynamics and Conflict Management\">Team Dynamics and Conflict Management</a><br></li><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/HR_Principles_and_TQM/Leadership_and_Commitment_of_Top_Management_in_Implementing_TQM_6/story.html\" title=\"Leadership and Commitment of Top Management in Implementing TQM\">Leadership and Commitment of Top Management in Implementing TQM</a><br></li><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/HR_Principles_and_TQM/Team_Building_and_Evolution_7/story.html\" title=\"Team Building and Evolution\">Team Building and Evolution</a><br></li><li><a href=\"http://e-learning.zedcs.com/TQM/HR_Principles_and_TQM/Management_Styles_&am