(311, 'C4', 'Process Control', 'Application of statistical quality control method,   to monitor and control processes, to identify variances as a basis for continual improvement\r\n', '7', 10, '', '', 'No standards/SOPs available to define control plans\r\nNo documented process control plan improvement in place\r\nNo approach exists for process control\r\nNo concept of CAPA to address variances in processes\r\n', 'SOPs / work instructions initiated to control few critical/key processes\r\nProcess control plans in place with adherence &lt;40%\r\nProcess control approach followed on adhoc basis\r\nCAPA to control variances identified in &lt;50% critical processes\r\n', 'Details SOPs / Work instructions are available basis control plans to ease the process understanding\r\nProcess control plans in place with adherence 40%-60%\r\n Process control approach available for critical processes\r\nCAPAs to control variances identified in >50% critical processes\r\n', ' Frequent revisions are made in Control plans / SOPs and work instructions basis any process change. Product samples (First piece inspection) are also kept near workstation for referencing purpose\r\nProcess control plans in place with adherence >60%-90%\r\n Process control approach available and scope well defined for all processes\r\nCAPAs to control variances are identified and implemented in all cases\r\n', ' Electronic version of control plans / SOPs / Work instructions are deployed\r\nProcess control plans in place with adherence >90%\r\n Online controls in place for process controls\r\nCAPAs to control variances taken in all cases and recorded, effectiveness is also measured\r\n', 1, '2017-05-30 10:43:26', 1, '2017-05-30 17:13:26', 0),
