(455, 'E4', 'Recall Systems', 'Mechanism for tracing and recalling products that cannot be consumed\r\n', '7', 12, '', '', 'No traceability/recall mechanisms in place\r\nNo record keeping system in place\r\nNo recall process in place\r\n', 'Process for tracing and identification of retail outlets and specific products, in place\r\nRecords keeping on paper books, no digital account\r\nRecall process in place but not followed\r\n', ' Simple computerised mechanisms in place for tracing and identifying shops and products\r\nTime to identify relevant shops for recall of products takes >24 hours\r\nRecall process in place but implementation is a challenge with no defined timelines and ownership\r\n', ' Computerised mechanisms for processing records and tracing and identifying shops and products\r\nTime to identify relevant shops for recall of products takes >4 hours\r\nProper recall process and protocol in place; Timelines and ownership of specific consignment defined by quality department\r\n', ' Automated mechanisms in place that quickly process records for tracing and identifying shops\r\nProper recall process and protocol in place; Timelines and ownership of all consignments defined by quality department\r\nProper recall process and protocol in place; Timelines and ownership of all consignments defined by quality department\r\n', 1, '2017-05-31 04:51:10', 1, '2017-05-31 10:21:10', 1),
