(503, 'F2', 'Systems for Abatement of Effluent, Emissions and Wastes', 'Design  plant & equipment and processes as a an integral part of manufacturing or service delivery systems so as to eliminate, reduce, treat or dispose effluents / emissions and solid wastes\r\n', '7', 13, '', '', 'Adhoc approach to ensure reduced effluents, emissions and wastes\r\nNo infrastructure in place to ensure environment performance\r\nNo mechanism for ensuring environmental compliance\r\nNo improvement observed in environmental variances\r\n', 'A compliance register has been developed identifying the legal requirements that the organisation has to meet from environmental aspect\r\nPlant equipment are in place to address major effluents / emissions\r\nSystem in place for yearly checking environmental compliance\r\n&lt;50% improvement observed in environmental variances\r\n', 'A compliance register has been developed identifying the legal requirements that the organisation has to meet from environmental aspect and the requirements have been implemented\r\nPlant equipments are in place to address complete compliance effluents / emissions and has systems to handle disposal of wastes\r\nSystem in place for semi-annually checking environmental compliance\r\n50%-75% improvement observed in environmental variances\r\n', ' Organisation has put in place the environment management system\r\n Organisation has optimised the use of raw materials and other inputs by extensive recycle and reuse\r\n Quarterly internal audit and yearly external audit of environmental compliance is carried out\r\n>75%-95% improvement observed in environmental variances\r\n', ' System in place to benchmark the process in use against world\'s best for the products for minimum effluent, emission and wastes\r\n Continually upgrades technology/process to phase out use of hazardous substances and improve environmental performance going beyond statutory norms\r\n Publishes its \'sustainability report\' addressing Triple bottom line Impact measurement (Environment, social and economic)\r\n>95% improvement observed in environmental variances\r\n', 1, '2017-05-31 05:44:42', 1, '2017-05-31 00:14:42', 0),
