Energy performance indicators are linked to business strategy and business performance\r\n World class technology used with long term focus on energy conservation and improvement in addition to calibration of meters in areas of high energy consumption\r\n Advocating energy management system to external audiences and forming new energy management partnerships for innovation and R&D\r\n Publishes its \'energy efficiency report\r\n>95% improvement observed in variances\r\n', 1, '2017-05-31 05:46:10', 1, '2017-05-31 00:16:10', 0),
