(575, 'G1', 'Installation of Environmental Protection and Measuring Systems', 'Install plant & equipment, monitoring mechanisms required to eliminate, reduce, treat or dispose effluents/emissions and solid wastes as per design for every new process or product line\r\n', '7', 14, '', '', 'No awareness on environmental protection and measuring equipment\r\nNo environmental protection and measuring equipment identified. Main focus is on completion of production plants\r\nNo equipment installed, No system of measuring environmental discharges and compliance\r\n', 'Training provided on environmental protection and measuring equipment to key people on the shop floor But commissioning of production units not held up if ETPs or emission control equipment are not ready\r\nSelective environmental management equipment taken up simultaneously with the production units\r\nSelective equipment only along with production units\r\n', ' Service manuals are in place for all the environmental protection and measuring equipment. Regular calibration activities are performed on these equipment’s to ensure correct output\r\n Necessary environmental management equipment, measuring devices and production units form total package of the project\r\nAll Necessary equipment deployed in firm\r\n', ' Satisfactory dry trial runs of all environmental protection and measuring equipment are completed before commissioning of the complex\r\n Installation of all production units and environmental management & measuring systems are completed before taking up commissioning activities and Continuous equipment up-gradation in place\r\n Pollution control facilities Installation happens before taking up any commissioning activities\r\n', ' Highly intelligent measurement systems are also installed to track the performance of the effluent treatment and emission control equipment\r\n EMS backed by highly intelligent measurement systems are fully integrated with the production process and are in place prior to commissioning\r\n Highly intelligent measurement systems are integrated with the production process\r\n', 1, '2017-05-31 05:49:41', 1, '2017-05-31 00:19:41', 0),
