(671, 'J1', 'Disposal After Use', 'Have information to educate consumer for product disposal in an environmentally safe manner and to provide for disposal systems where required by statute or environment impact level is high\r\n', '7', 17, '', '', 'No instructions on environmentally safe disposal of products after use\r\nCustomer education on safe disposal not done\r\nNo monitoring and Review Mechanism\r\n', 'Only basic information on use, storage and safe disposal of its products after use mentioned in packaging\r\nAdhoc instructions on safe disposal\r\nupto 30% Products are covered\r\n', ' Organisation has done assessment for disposal of product in an environment friendly manner after its use and communicated through product literature to its customers ; While designing and manufacturing of a product life cycle of product has been considered (Crude to grave)\r\nDetailed instructions on safe disposal and return policy for environmentally unsafe disposal items\r\n30-50% products are covered\r\n', ' Complete information on safe disposal of its products after use printed on packaging. Wide publicity to the same for educating the customers is done. Education in the form of forums, blogs, Videos / On-line channels like You-tube etc. done\r\nDetailed instructions on its use, storage and safe disposal mentioned on the packaging\r\nAll products are covered; Customer awareness survey Index\r\n', ' As a policy, organisation reviews the potential negative impacts of its products after use and adopts state-of-the-art technology including use of alternate raw materials to reduce such impacts.\r\nCustomers are educated in addition to detailed instructions on packaging\r\n Continuous monitoring and review in place\r\n', 1, '2017-05-31 05:55:57', 1, '2017-05-31 00:25:57', 0),
(672, 'J1', 'Disposal After Use', 'Have information to educate consumer for product disposal in an environmentally safe manner and to provide for disposal systems where required by statute or environment impact level is high\r\n', '8', 17, '', '', 'No instructions on environmentally safe disposal of products after use\r\nCustomer education on safe disposal not done\r\nNo monitoring and Review Mechanism\r\n', 'Only basic information on use, storage and safe disposal of its products after use mentioned in packaging\r\nAdhoc instructions on safe disposal\r\nupto 30% Products are covered\r\n', ' Organisation has done assessment for disposal of product in an environment friendly manner after its use and communicated through product literature to its customers ; While designing and manufacturing of a product life cycle of product has been considered (Crude to grave)\r\nDetailed instructions on safe disposal and return policy for environmentally unsafe disposal items\r\n30-50% products are covered\r\n', ' Complete information on safe disposal of its products after use printed on packaging. Wide publicity to the same for educating the customers is done. Education in the form of forums, blogs, Videos / On-line channels like You-tube etc. done\r\nDetailed instructions on its use, storage and safe disposal mentioned on the packaging\r\nAll products are covered; Customer awareness survey Index\r\n', ' As a policy, organisation reviews the potential negative impacts of its products after use and adopts state-of-the-art technology including use of alternate raw materials to reduce such impacts.\r\nCustomers are educated in addition to detailed instructions on packaging\r\n Continuous monitoring and review in place\r\n', 1, '2017-05-31 05:55:57', 1, '2017-05-31 00:25:57', 0),
