(694, 'J1', 'Disposal After Use', 'Have information to educate consumer for product disposal in an environmentally safe manner and to provide for disposal systems where required by statute or environment impact level is high\r\n', '30', 17, '', '', 'No instructions on environmentally safe disposal of products after use\r\nCustomer education on safe disposal not done\r\nNo monitoring and Review Mechanism\r\n', 'Only basic information on use, storage and safe disposal of its products after use mentioned in packaging\r\nAdhoc instructions on safe disposal\r\nupto 30% Products are covered\r\n', ' Organisation has done assessment for disposal of product in an environment friendly manner after its use and communicated through product literature to its customers ; While designing and manufacturing of a product life cycle of product has been considered (Crude to grave)\r\nDetailed instructions on safe disposal and return policy for environmentally unsafe disposal items\r\n30-50% products are covered\r\n', ' Complete information on safe disposal of its products after use printed on packaging. Wide publicity to the same for educating the customers is done. Education in the form of forums, blogs, Videos / On-line channels like You-tube etc. done\r\nDetailed instructions on its use, storage and safe disposal mentioned on the packaging\r\nAll products are covered; Customer awareness survey Index\r\n', ' As a policy, organisation reviews the potential negative impacts of its products after use and adopts state-of-the-art technology including use of alternate raw materials to reduce such impacts.\r\nCustomers are educated in addition to detailed instructions on packaging\r\n Continuous monitoring and review in place\r\n', 1, '2017-05-31 05:55:57', 1, '2017-05-31 00:25:57', 0),
(695, 'K1', 'Plant Layout', 'Planning for the location of all machines, utilities, employee workstations, material storage areas, pathways, service areas, space necessary for the operation of processes, and for the flow of materials and people movement within plant area\r\n', '7', 18, '', '', 'Existing layout does not have provisions for future expansion or changes to the product mix\r\nNo specific team available to ensure improvements In layout\r\nUnorganized way of plant lay outing , machines / equipment are kept un-systematically , no specific flow is maintained\r\n', 'Specific team established responsible for plant lay outing to ensure layout conducive to linear material flow\r\nPeople are trained and teams are formed for improvements in layout. Specific team established responsible for linear flow\r\nSome efforts to improve plant layout, e.g. Wastes attributed to unplanned layout are identified, pathway markings available\r\n', ' Layout supports full segregation of material based on grades and types, rework, reject status on the shop floor\r\n Layouts are reviewed periodically and improved\r\nLayout considers flow from raw material receipt to dispatch point with straight line pathways\r\n', ' Reduction in material distance, time and manpower is measured and reviewed for continual improvement\r\n Comparison of various layout options with the help of cross functional team. Lean principles & process is established in organization\r\n Visual management of total flow and plant layout exist\r\n', ' Focus on Multipurpose machines / equipment to avoid space constraints\r\n Lean layout solutions have Improved safety and reduced production lead times. Cellular designs\r\n Regular monitoring of benefits of improved layout is done for PDCA\r\n', 1, '2017-05-31 05:57:17', 1, '2017-05-31 00:27:17', 0),
