(34, 'Application invited for participation in ZED Master Training / Assessor / Consultant Training Programmes.', 'application-invited-for-participation-in-zed-master-training-assessor-consultant-training-programmes', '7904a148ed7e15041a14285dec2af084.jpg', 'https://zed.org.in/photogallery/7904a148ed7e15041a14285dec2af084.jpg', '<p>The training programs are one of the most important components</p><p>of the ZED scheme as the ZED Master Trainers, Assessors and Consultants will play a pivotal role in ZED assessment &amp; certification, consultancy to MSMEs for their graduation to higher levels.</p>', '', 1, '', 0, NULL, 'Application invited for participation in ZED Master Training / Assessor / Consultant Training Programmes.', 'Application invited for participation in ZED Master Training / Assessor / Consultant Training Programmes.', 'Application invited for participation in ZED Master Training / Assessor / Consultant Training Programmes.', '0000-00-00', 2, '2021-01-28 04:37:46', 1, '2019-03-19 11:24:21', 1),
